  <div class="container mx-auto p-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center text-primary mb-8">How to Play Clank!</h1>

    <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl mb-6">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="card-title">1. Start the Game</h2>
        <p>Players take turns in clockwise order. On your turn, play ALL cards from your hand to move, fight monsters, and acquire new cards from the dungeon row.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl mb-6">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="card-title">2. Escape the Dungeon</h2>
        <p>Once you've acquired enough treasures and feel ready, make your way to the exit to escape the dungeon before the dragon catches you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl mb-6">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="card-title">3. End the Game</h2>
        <p>The game ends when all players have either escaped the dungeon or have been knocked out by the dragon. The player with the most points wins!</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
